menuconfig SYSTEMCMDS_SERIAL_CONFIG
	bool "serial_config"
	default n
	depends on PLATFORM_NUTTX && ARCH_CHIP_STM32H7
	---help---
		Apply SER_*_SWAP before starting an automatically configured serial service.
		Currently supported on STM32H7, where the UART driver preserves SWAP across
		close/reopen. The NuttX configuration must enable STM32H7_USART_SWAP.
		This command does not run a background task.
